@startuml
title 批量重命名用例实现顺序图
participant "机主" as P0
participant "RenameDialog" as P1
participant "ImageServiceImpl" as P2
participant "Files" as P3
participant "ImageDao" as P4
participant "PostgreSQL" as P5
P0 -> P1: 输入前缀/起始编号/位数
P1 -> P2: batchRename(images, rule)
P2 -> P5: setAutoCommit(false)
P2 -> P3: Files.move(old,new)
P2 -> P4: updateFileName(id,newPath)
P4 -> P5: UPDATE images + trigger log
P2 -> P5: commit()
P2 -> P1: 返回结果
P1 -> P0: 提示成功并刷新
note over P0,P5: 异常路径：任一文件或SQL失败时 rollback()，并按 rollbackList 恢复已改名文件。
@enduml
